== guide quotes ==
ok   guide contains: "Only side-neighbors count; there are no outside cells or wraparound edges."
ok   guide contains: "Let C be any closed set containing the seeds, where closed means no outside cell has two neighbors in C."
ok   guide contains: "A terminal run is itself closed and therefore is contained in every closed superset of the seeds."
ok   guide contains: "If there is no legal addition, the total is 3."
ok   guide contains: "If those two seeds are diagonally opposite corners of a unit square, their closure is that 2 × 2 square."
ok   guide contains: "A third seed on that line gives 3;"
ok   guide contains: "Otherwise two seeds support a first addition."
ok   guide contains: "Removing the four seeds in that order leaves terminal counts 6, 3, 3, 6."
ok   guide contains: "the checker finds 9 inclusion-minimal four-seed starts on 3 × 3"
ok   guide contains: "There are 14 three-seed filling starts."
ok   guide contains: "In the three printed pictures the before/after counts are 8 → 8, 12 → 10 and 16 → 12, respectively."
ok   guide contains: "For the three diagonal seeds, there are four legal first additions;"

FAILURES: 0
